:41:17Z","body":"This error is just stupid. Why does it care whether the pointer is freed or not? I only want to use the address, not whatever it's pointing to. How to tell the sanitizer that I know that the pointer is invalid and it doesn't matter here? I could just convert it to integer or whatever, but that probably also counts as \"use\".","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3621042446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649633852","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113642#issuecomment-3649633852","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113642","id":3649633852,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ZiP48","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T17:16:39Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T17:16:39Z","body":"The address sanitizer checks when passing into a function apparently. There are function attributes like `__attribute__((no_sanitize(\"address\")))` that can be used but they depend on compiler and disable it for the whole function.\r\n\r\nIt should work if it is moved to predelete or enter/exit tree, right?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649633852/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3649760587","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113642#issuecomment-3649760587","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113642","id":3649760587,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ziu1L","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T20:02:37Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T20:02:59Z","body":"Predelete is too late, not sure about exit tree.\r\nBut it would be nice if I could avoid making the changes more complex just to \"fix\" some false positive in CI :/","author_association":"